&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of advanced manufacturing processes such as CNC machining, automated assembly, robotics, surface processing, cleaning, inspection/metrology, or automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with document control, revision control, engineering change management, and Quality Management Systems (QMS).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AS9100 or similar regulated manufacturing quality systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading small technical documentation, training, process-improvement, or knowledge-management projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating visual and multimedia technical content, including diagrams, photographs, videos, screen captures, and process flows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing documentation standards, templates, and best practices that improve consistency and scalability across an organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor or provide technical guidance to peers without formal people-management responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Work Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
