&lt;li&gt;Work may involve technically demanding manufacturing environments containing CNC equipment, automated machinery, robotics, inspection equipment, chemical processing, and other industrial systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires ownership, collaboration, initiative, sound technical judgment, and a strong quality mindset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May support documentation and training initiatives across multiple work centers, shifts, programs, and manufacturing facilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
