&lt;p&gt;At Divergent, our pay range is based on the level of the job. For this role, we will consider candidates at levels&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;T01 - T04&lt;/strong&gt; as evaluated through our interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
