&lt;li&gt;Establish shared application frameworks, architecture standards, and reusable software capabilities that support development across the DES organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the architecture of scalable GPU compute orchestration, clustered GPU job scheduling, and resource management for computationally intensive engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate emerging technical challenges and develop solutions to complex problems spanning application architecture, graphics rendering, UI frameworks, computational workloads, and platform integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive major technical initiatives that improve software scalability, application performance, development efficiency, and architectural consistency across multiple programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish architectural principles and technical decision frameworks that guide software design, technology selection, and cross-team implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve systemic technical dependencies and integration challenges across desktop applications, shared services, computational design systems, and engineering platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence technical roadmaps and architectural priorities across DES and Platform IPT, aligning investments with long-term computational design and engineering objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide functional architectural guidance to engineering teams and senior technical contributors, ensuring complex systems are designed for reliability, maintainability, and extensibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architecture reviews and major technical design decisions, balancing program requirements with broader system-level considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish approaches for integrating topology optimization, computational geometry, CAE solvers, and GPU-accelerated computation into cohesive engineering applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior and staff-level engineers and strengthen architectural decision-making and technical leadership across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the function in high-impact technical discussions with engineering leadership, platform stakeholders, customers, and vendors as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate architectural risks, emerging technologies, and technology investments that may affect multiple programs or product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
