&lt;h2&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lawfully access information and technology that is subject to US export controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience operating and optimizing multi-axis CNC machines, including 3-axis, 3+2, and full 5-axis machining centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with Siemens and Heidenhain controllers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of GD&amp;amp;T and its practical application in precision machining and inspection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to diagnose, troubleshoot, and optimize complex machining processes including tooling, fixturing, and program strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience machining complex 5-axis components across multiple alloys (e.g., aluminum, steels, titanium, nickel-based alloys).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and implementing dynamic work offsets and advanced setup strategies for complex parts and fixtures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience setting up and running complex 5-axis CNC operations in prototype and/or production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring machinists and operators, supporting skill development and promoting strong machining practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop work instructions, setup documentation, and standardized machining procedures to ensure repeatability and process reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;36&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience machining additively manufactured components and working with hybrid additive-subtractive workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
