&lt;li&gt;Vacuum systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process cooling water systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pneumatic systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forklift, scissor lift, or boom lift certification.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welding, fabrication, or machining experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic PLC or industrial controls troubleshooting experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working around robotic or automated manufacturing equipment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting and root cause analysis skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and communication abilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with minimal supervision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented with a proactive approach to problem solving.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable in a rapidly evolving manufacturing environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to safety and operational excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Work Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequently stand, walk, bend, climb, kneel, and reach throughout the shift.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
