&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Divergent is building the new industrial age. Every day, our teams design, manufacture, and assemble advanced systems for some of the world’s most demanding industries. Our integrated engineering and manufacturing platform transforms complex designs into production-ready solutions, helping customers move faster, build smarter, and deliver critical systems when they matter most. Divergent is a qualified Tier 1 supplier to global automotive OEMs and supports leading U.S. aerospace and defense companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and help push the boundaries of what can be built.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Purpose&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a Full‑Stack Software Engineer with solid experience in application development, data modeling, and feature implementation to join our growing team. In this role you will write clean, efficient code, help evolve our platforms, and collaborate closely with product, design, and other engineers to deliver high‑quality features on schedule.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full‑stack Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, and maintain scalable applications using modern web technologies, with a primary focus on TypeScript (Node.js and front‑end frameworks such as React or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Modeling &amp;amp; Persistence:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and evolve relational and NoSQL data models that support new functionality and improve existing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Own individual features from specification through implementation, testing, deployment, and post‑release monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in peer code reviews, write unit/integration tests, and follow best practices to ensure maintainable, high‑quality code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Produce clear design specs, API documentation, and other artifacts that aid knowledge sharing across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with product managers, designers, and other engineers to translate business requirements into technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Participation:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to sprint planning, backlog grooming, and estimation sessions as an active member of the development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
