&lt;li&gt;Ability to lawfully access information and technology that is subject to US export controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8 years of experience in full‑stack development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in TypeScript with solid experience in Node.js and modern front‑end frameworks (React, Vue, Angular, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of relational and NoSQL data modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and build scalable, maintainable application components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to write clear, concise design and technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills; comfortable engaging with non‑technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering features end‑to‑end, including planning, coding, testing, and deployment&lt;/li&gt;
