malTextRun SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt; you will serve as the “face” of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;Information Security &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;program in the Classified and Controlled Unclassified Information systems to both internal and external stakeholders (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;e.g.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt; customer, regulatory, government and supplier entities)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW201952022 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
