&lt;h3&gt;Production Leadership Partnership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key recruiting partner to Production leadership and front-line hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support recruiting intake meetings to ensure clear alignment on candidate requirements, technical qualifications, interview processes, and hiring urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish regular recruiting cadence meetings with key Production leaders to review priorities, pipelines, aging requisitions, upcoming hiring needs, and roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hiring managers with visibility into talent availability, candidate pipelines, recruiting activity, and market challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach hiring managers on effective candidate evaluation, interviewing, timely feedback, and recruiting best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate hiring risks, capacity constraints, and process bottlenecks when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adjust recruiting resources and sourcing strategies as production hiring priorities change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Recruiting Operations &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use recruiting data to evaluate team performance and identify opportunities to improve recruiting speed and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor metrics such as time to fill, time in stage, pipeline health, sourcing activity, offer acceptance, aging requisitions, and progress against hiring plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure candidate and requisition activity is accurately and consistently maintained in Greenhouse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Recruiting leadership on recruiting capacity, prioritization, workforce planning, and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve production recruiting through technology, automation, AI, sourcing tools, events, partnerships, and more efficient workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistent candidate assessment and recruiting standards across Production hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
