&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Divergent, our pay range is based on the level of the job. For this role, we will consider candidates at levels M06 - M07 as evaluated through our interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager / M06: $142,900 - $196,500&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager / M07: $165,800 - $227,950&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
