&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead structural design and analysis activities across programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop CAD, FEA, and BOM structures for aerospace applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide structural optimization, validation, and product development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional technical efforts with manufacturing, test, and design teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and support continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS in Mechanical or Aerospace Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of structural engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced CAD and FEA experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of aerospace structures, loads, and materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technical programs or complex development efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
