&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Sr. Specialist / S05 description: $109,240 - $150,210&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
