&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to lawfully access information and technology that is subject to US export controls&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
