&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Standard Cost Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt; Serve as a subject-matter expert for standard costing, providing guidance on costing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;, inventory valuation, and related accounting practices to Finance and cross-functional partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; Own standard cost records and methodologies, ensuring ERP cost data appropriately reflects approved processes, operational changes, accounting requirements, and cost methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; Perform complex costing and work order analysis to evaluate inventory valuation,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;identify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;systemic issues, and determine&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;appropriate accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;treatment and process improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; Analyze cost variances including purchase price variance (PPV),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;identify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;root causes and interdependencies across operational processes, and drive corrective actions or standard cost updates as appropriate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; Define and improve standard costing practices and controls as manufacturing processes, systems, and business requirements evolve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Reconciliations and Analyses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt; Own inventory and cost account reconciliations, including raw materials, WIP, and finished goods, and independently resolve complex or recurring accounting issues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; Develop and maintain PPV analysis, absorption reporting, and other cost variance workpapers that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;actionable insight into manufacturing and financial performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Validate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;inventory movements and production data against ERP records; independently investigate complex breaks,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;root causes, and lead resolution across Finance and Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Identify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;trends and systemic issues across inventory and cost accounting workstreams and recommend changes to accounting practices, operational processes, or system controls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Policy, Procedures, and Documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt; Define and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;maintain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;First Paragraph&quot;&gt;reconciliation templates, trackers, standards, and process documentation for recurring close activities and one-time events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt; Own documentation of inventory valuation, cost recognition, standard cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;assumptions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in a clear, audit-ready format as processes evolve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Establish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;and continuously improve cost accounting workflows, standards, and controls to improve repeatability, scalability, and process continuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;technical guidance to accounting peers and cross-functional partners on cost accounting processes, controls, and methodologies and proactively share knowledge and best practices across the function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
