&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Divergent, our pay range is based on the level of the job. For this role, we will consider candidates at levels E04 - E05 as evaluated through our interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
