&lt;p&gt;Join us and help push the boundaries of what can be built.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Purpose&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW103796763 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103796763 BCX8&quot;&gt;In this role, you are essential to ensure that Divergent components and assemblies never compromise on safety, durability, or performance. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103796763 BCX8&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW103796763 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;be hands-on—designing custom hardware, building test methods from the ground up, and leading the validation work that directly shapes our engineering decisions and the quality of the final product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW103796763 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
