&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2989&quot; data-end=&quot;3371&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2989&quot; data-end=&quot;3112&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Manufacturing Engineering, Robotics, Product, Operations, Quality, and Design Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3113&quot; data-end=&quot;3204&quot;&gt;Translate complex operational and business requirements into scalable software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3205&quot; data-end=&quot;3275&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor across engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3276&quot; data-end=&quot;3371&quot;&gt;Lead technical discussions and influence key decisions impacting multiple teams and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
