&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3401&quot; data-end=&quot;3807&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3401&quot; data-end=&quot;3517&quot;&gt;Establish software engineering best practices, coding standards, testing strategies, and architectural guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3518&quot; data-end=&quot;3597&quot;&gt;Lead architecture reviews, design reviews, and technical planning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3598&quot; data-end=&quot;3717&quot;&gt;Drive improvements in reliability, observability, scalability, security, and maintainability across software systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3718&quot; data-end=&quot;3807&quot;&gt;Identify and proactively mitigate technical risks affecting long-term platform success.&lt;/li&gt;
