&lt;li data-start=&quot;3910&quot; data-end=&quot;4012&quot;&gt;Raise the technical bar across the organization through coaching, code reviews, and design guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4013&quot; data-end=&quot;4108&quot;&gt;Lead major technical initiatives involving multiple stakeholders and engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4109&quot; data-end=&quot;4196&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, innovation, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
