&lt;li data-start=&quot;4223&quot; data-end=&quot;4311&quot;&gt;Ability to lawfully access information and technology subject to U.S. export controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4312&quot; data-end=&quot;4458&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Computer Engineering, or related technical field; equivalent experience considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4459&quot; data-end=&quot;4519&quot;&gt;10+ years of professional software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4520&quot; data-end=&quot;4592&quot;&gt;Extensive experience building and scaling production software systems.&lt;/li&gt;
