&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;379&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c2e411615c57&quot;&gt;Own system architecture&amp;nbsp;for multithreaded&amp;nbsp;C++&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Python&amp;nbsp;applications across robotics control, automation, AI/ML, and optimization pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;524&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fce7d364cb32&quot;&gt;Architect end-to-end solutions&amp;nbsp;from design through production deployment: operator-facing GUIs, diagnostics, monitoring, simulation/modeling, calibration, and fault-detection systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;711&quot; data-local-id=&quot;490560be1fc6&quot;&gt;Design scalable, reliable integrations with&amp;nbsp;robotics stacks (ROS/ROS2, MoveIt), electromechanical hardware, sensors, and manufacturing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;858&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4f173dd46c03&quot;&gt;Define architecture for&amp;nbsp;planning/optimization&amp;nbsp;(SAT/SMT, constraint programming, PDDL/planners) and&amp;nbsp;generative AI / agentic systems&amp;nbsp;(LLMs, multimodal models, multi-agent orchestration, inference optimization).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1070&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1222e238898a&quot;&gt;Establish&amp;nbsp;CI/CD,&amp;nbsp;containerization (Docker/Kubernetes), build systems (CMake), automated testing, code quality, and engineering best practices across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1229&quot; data-local-id=&quot;76f46e365685&quot;&gt;Lead technical design, review, and mentoring; collaborate cross-functionally with controls, electrical, mechanical, systems, manufacturing, data, legal, and product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bcea714e7a3b&quot;&gt;Drive commissioning, troubleshooting, and continuous improvement; support production hardware integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
