&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Divergent is building the new industrial age. Every day, our teams design, manufacture, and assemble advanced systems for some of the world’s most demanding industries. Our integrated engineering and manufacturing platform transforms complex designs into production-ready solutions, helping customers move faster, build smarter, and deliver critical systems when they matter most. Divergent is a qualified Tier 1 supplier to global automotive OEMs and supports leading U.S. aerospace and defense companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and help push the boundaries of what can be built.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Purpose&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Divergent aims to revolutionize industrial manufacturing in the aerospace and defense industries through our DAPS (Divergent Adaptive Production System) technology. Our patented production system incorporates Nodes™ – 3D-printed metal connectors – with lightweight materials to create strong and efficient complex structures. Divergent’s technology eliminates tooling and drives radical innovation, capital reduction, and sustainability in vehicle manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Divergent is seeking a skilled and motivated engineer to support the next generation of industry-leading aerospace vehicle development. We’re committed to transforming vehicles’ structural systems away from traditional manufacturing by using new materials and new technologies.&amp;nbsp; To do this, we need a forward-looking and innovative engineer who will help shape the future of automotive structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Structures Engineer, you will lead complex structural engineering projects and support technical execution across multiple programs while serving as a domain expert within the engineering organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead structural design and analysis activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage CAD models, FE models, and BOMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform advanced structural analysis, optimization, and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support manufacturing, testing, and prototype build activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root cause investigations and continuous improvement efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers and support technical development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
