&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS in Mechanical or Aerospace Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of structural engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong CAD and FEA experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with aerospace loads, lightweight structures, and advanced materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
