&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active leadership in Formula SAE, Baja, Hyperloop, rocket, UAV, or design teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2405&quot; data-end=&quot;2474&quot;&gt;Familiarity with additive manufacturing technologies or robotics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2405&quot; data-end=&quot;2474&quot;&gt;Experience with automation, control systems, or data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2547&quot; data-end=&quot;2645&quot;&gt;Prior project, lab, or internship experience in advanced manufacturing or product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
