&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Divergent, our pay range is based on the level of the job. For this role, we will consider candidates at levels S04 - S07 as evaluated through our interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Recruiter/S04: $94,610 - 130,090&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Senior Recruiter/S05: $109,240 - $150,210&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Lead Recruiter/S06: $126,160 - 173,470&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
